-- Description:
-- Function to return the source MDB of the MDB Copy form.
-- Function to be replaced by method !!admMdbCpy.refGet()
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Function Type:   Function/Procedure
-- Arguments:
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
-- Return:
--   [Data Type] [Description]
--    DBREF       Source MDB
